      *                                                               *
      * Work file for Division Add transaction                        *
      *    This file will store the new division# to be used          *
      *    in STLETTER to print darts remarks for the new division.   *
      *================================================================
      *                                                               *
      * CREATED ON 09/28/18   BY C:267  PROJECT 50562                 *
      *            10/26/18      C:267  PROJECT 50562                 *
      *                          Add new job# field                   *
      *===============================================================+
      * REVISIONS:                                                    *
      *                                                               *
      *                                                               *
      *****************************************************************
      *
     A                                      REF(WREFP)
     A          R PDA01                     TEXT('Work file added division#')
      *
     A            PDCO#     R               REFFLD(CO#)
     A                                      COLHDG('COMPANY' 'NUMBER')
      *
     A            PDFND     R               REFFLD(FND)
     A                                      COLHDG('GROUP' 'NUMBER')
      *
     A            PDEMP#    R               REFFLD(EMP#)
     A                                      COLHDG('EMPLOYER' 'NUMBER')
      *
     A            PDFYR     R               REFFLD(FYR)
     A                                      COLHDG('POLICY' 'YEAR')
      *
     A            PDDIV     R               REFFLD(DIV)
     A                                      COLHDG('DIVISION')
      *
     A            PDJOBN    R               REFFLD(A60)
     A                                      COLHDG('JOB' 'NUMBER')
      *
     A            PDEND#    R               REFFLD(SEQ#)
     A                                      COLHDG('ENDORSEMENT' 'FORM')
      *
     A            PDEFDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('ENDORSEMENT' +
     A                                      'EFFECTIVE' 'DATE')
      *
     A            PDNAME    R               REFFLD(NAME)
     A                                      COLHDG('EMPLOYER' 'NAME')
      *
     A            PDNWDV    R               REFFLD(DIV)
     A                                      COLHDG('NEW' 'DIVISION')
      *
     A            PDUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('MAINT' 'USER')
     A            PDPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('MAINT' 'PROGRAM')
     A            PDTIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A                                      COLHDG('MAINT' 'TIME')
     A            PDDT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('MAINT' 'DATE')
      *
     A            PDNJBN    R               REFFLD(A60)
     A                                      COLHDG('NEW' 'JOB' 'NUMBER')
      *
